Project Design Phase Phase
PocketSmart AI: Your Smart Budget & Recommendation Assistant

Project Design Phase

1. Introduction

The Design Phase of the PocketSmart AI project converts the requirements identified in the Requirement Analysis Phase into a clear technical and visual design.

PocketSmart AI is an intelligent budget management and recommendation assistant that helps users manage their income, expenses, savings, and spending habits. The system uses AI-based analysis to provide personalized recommendations and help users make better financial decisions.


---

2. Objectives of the Design Phase

The main objectives are:

To design a simple and user-friendly interface.

To define the overall system architecture.

To design the database structure.

To design the budget and expense management modules.

To design the AI recommendation system.

To define the flow of information between different modules.

To ensure security and privacy of user data.

To make the application responsive and easy to use.



---

