4. Main Modules

4.1 User Authentication Module

This module manages user registration and login.

Functions:

Create account

Login

Logout

Password protection

User profile management



---

4.2 Dashboard Module

The dashboard provides a quick overview of the user's financial information.

It displays:

Total income

Total expenses

Available balance

Savings

Budget status

Recent transactions

AI recommendations



---

4.3 Income Management Module

Users can record their income sources.

Example:

Income Source	Amount

Salary	₹25,000
Part-time work	₹5,000
Other	₹2,000


The system calculates the total monthly income automatically.


---

4.4 Expense Management Module

Users can add and categorize their expenses.

Categories:

Food

Travel

Education

Shopping

Bills

Entertainment

Healthcare

Other


The system keeps track of spending in each category.


---

4.5 Budget Management Module

Users can create a monthly budget.

For example:

Monthly Income     : ₹30,000

Food               : ₹5,000
Travel             : ₹3,000
Education          : ₹4,000
Shopping           : ₹3,000
Bills              : ₹5,000
Savings            : ₹10,000

The system compares the planned budget with actual expenses.


---

4.6 AI Recommendation Module

This is the main intelligent component of PocketSmart AI.

The system analyzes:

Income

Expenses

Spending categories

Budget limits

Savings

Previous spending patterns


Based on the analysis, it generates personalized recommendations.

Example:

> "Your food expenses have increased this month. Consider reducing unnecessary food purchases and setting a lower weekly food budget."




---

4.7 Savings Module

This module helps users monitor their savings.

It can show:

Monthly savings

Savings percentage

Savings goal

Progress toward the goal


Example:

Savings Goal: ₹50,000

Current Savings: ₹32,000
Progress: 64%


---

4.8 Reports and Analytics Module

The system provides visual reports such as:

Monthly expense chart

Category-wise spending

Income vs expense

Savings trends

Budget utilization


Charts and graphs make financial information easier to understand.


