9. AI Recommendation Design

The AI component follows this process:

User Financial Data
        ↓
Data Collection
        ↓
Data Processing
        ↓
Spending Pattern Analysis
        ↓
Identify Problems
        ↓
Generate Recommendation
        ↓
Display to User

For example:

Input:

Monthly income: ₹30,000

Food expenses: ₹8,000

Food budget: ₹5,000


AI Output:

> "Food spending is above your planned budget. Consider setting a weekly spending limit to control expenses."




