Conclusion

The Design Phase provides the technical blueprint for PocketSmart AI. It defines how users interact with the system, how financial data is stored and processed, and how the AI engine generates personalized budget recommendations. This design will serve as the foundation for the Development Phase, where the actual application will be implemented.
